        "template--16994979152119__421e7d85-4176-4cab-9243-54404d8a4f20-text-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Life is too short for gear that gives up before you do, especially when you’re deep in the Cederberg or setting up camp under the stars. Brave Hardy is run by real people who actually use this stuff, offering a no-nonsense range of equipment built for local conditions and heavy use. We handle the technical details so you can focus on your big adventure outside.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": true
          }
        }
