        "text_pEDBdy": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We get it. That feeling of not being prepared, the knot in your stomach when the trail gets tough – we've been there. And you know what? That's where the magic happens. It's in those moments of uncertainty that you discover your true grit, your inner Brave Hardy.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": true
