    "f4d544e1-8a7e-496e-b3c4-8b7089e6e76d": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "template--16994979152119__f4d544e1-8a7e-496e-b3c4-8b7089e6e76d-subheading-1": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "HELLO, WE ARE BRAVE HARDY"
          }
        },
        "template--16994979152119__f4d544e1-8a7e-496e-b3c4-8b7089e6e76d-heading-1": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why 'Brave Hardy'?",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "heading_h1": false
          }
        },
        "template--16994979152119__f4d544e1-8a7e-496e-b3c4-8b7089e6e76d-text-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Because ‘getting out there’ is an antidote to the mundane, an escape hatch from the ordinary. We didn't start this as just another startup; we birthed it from the restless spirit that craves for untrodden paths and uncharted territories.</p><p>We’re on a mission – to make premium outdoor gear accessible, because your next big adventure shouldn't be hindered by second-rate equipment.</p><p>We get it. That feeling of not being prepared, the knot in your stomach when the trail gets tough – we've been there. And you know what? That's where the magic happens. It's in those moments of uncertainty that you discover your true grit, your inner Brave Hardy.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "template--16994979152119__f4d544e1-8a7e-496e-b3c4-8b7089e6e76d-subheading-1",
