        "text_yRXRKL": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>After founding Yuppiechef in 2006 and selling it in 2021, we launched Brave Hardy: an outdoor distribution and retail company.</p><p>We carry the same commitment to quality and service that defined our work with kitchenware; but now, we're taking it into the bush.</p><p>Join us as we build a premium outdoor brand that equips, inspires, and backs every kind of outside adventure.</p><p><strong>– Shane & Andrew</strong></p>",
            "enlarge_text": true
          }
        }
      },
